# Defense-in-depth: keep documentation, specs, non-runtime scripts, and tests
# out of any `vercel deploy` upload bundle.
#
# The CI/CD pipeline (`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`) already uses
# `vercel deploy --prebuilt`, which uploads only `.vercel/output/` build
# artifacts — source files (including this list) are NOT included by that
# flow. This file guards against an accidental `vercel deploy` without
# `--prebuilt`, which WOULD upload the entire source tree.
#
# Patterns use gitignore syntax: a leading `/` anchors to the repo root,
# so the dir entries below WILL NOT match same-named directories nested
# inside apps/main/src/ or apps/rag/src/ (e.g., apps/rag/src/lib/db/).

/specs/
/docs/
/scripts/*
# .pnpmfile.mjs imports this during the hosted pnpm install.
!/scripts/check-node-runtime.mjs
/tests/
/db/

# Repo-level metadata that doesn't belong in deploy bundles
/MEMORY.md
/SESSION.md
/README.md

# Editor / OS noise (these patterns are intentionally NOT root-anchored —
# we want to ignore them at every depth).
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Workflows, CI, and local-dev orchestration
/.github/
/.husky/
